### Patch: Optimistic Concurrency for Task Board

Modify `src/taskBoard.ts`:

1. Add a `version` property to the board state.
2. Before any write operation, check that the stored version matches the expected version.
3. If mismatch, trigger a refresh and retry.
4. Increment version after successful write.

```typescript
// In TaskBoard class
private version = 0;

async addTask(text: string): Promise<void> {
  const expectedVersion = this.version;
  // Simulate network/async operation
  const currentState = this.loadState();
  if (currentState.version !== expectedVersion) {
    throw new Error('Stale write detected. Refreshing state...');
  }
  // Perform add
  this.tasks.push({ text, completed: false });
  this.version++;
  this.saveState();
}
```

This patch ensures that concurrent modifications are detected and the user is prompted to refresh.

